  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfTermAndConditionsOfFinancialAssetsPledgedAsCollateralForLiabilitiesOrContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialAssetsAxis_entity00113058_DepositsEtcMemberOfFinancialAssetsClassMemberOfDisclosureOfOtherFinancialAssetsPledgedAsSecurityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당분기말 현재 자금대출과 관련하여, 예치금 등 46,108백만원을 Bank for Investment and Development of Vietnam 외 6곳에 담보로 제공하고 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfTermAndConditionsOfFinancialAssetsPledgedAsCollateralForLiabilitiesOrContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfTermAndConditionsOfFinancialAssetsPledgedAsCollateralForLiabilitiesOrContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialAssetsAxis_entity00113058_AssetsReceivedAsCollateralMemberOfFinancialAssetsClassMemberOfDisclosureOfOtherFinancialAssetsPledgedAsSecurityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당분기말 현재 유통금융 및 담보금융 대출과 관련하여, 양도담보로 수취 또는 질권 설정한 주식 등 1,656,619백만원을 한국증권금융㈜에 담보로 제공하고 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfTermAndConditionsOfFinancialAssetsPledgedAsCollateralForLiabilitiesOrContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfTermAndConditionsOfFinancialAssetsPledgedAsCollateralForLiabilitiesOrContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialAssetsAxis_entity00113058_CertificateOfBeneficiaryRightsMemberOfFinancialAssetsClassMemberOfDisclosureOfOtherFinancialAssetsPledgedAsSecurityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당분기말 현재 차액결제대행업무와 관련하여 ㈜KB국민은행에 투자자예탁금별도예치금(신탁) 수익권증서 47,000백만원이 담보 설정되어 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfTermAndConditionsOfFinancialAssetsPledgedAsCollateralForLiabilitiesOrContingentLiabilities>
